{
  "sn2.29:0.1": "Saṁyutta Nikāya 2.29 ",
  "sn2.29:0.2": "3. Nānātitthiyavagga ",
  "sn2.29:0.3": "Susimasutta ",
  "sn2.29:1.1": "Sāvatthinidānaṁ. ",
  "sn2.29:1.2": "Atha kho āyasmā ānando yena bhagavā tenupasaṅkami; upasaṅkamitvā bhagavantaṁ abhivādetvā ekamantaṁ nisīdi. Ekamantaṁ nisinnaṁ kho āyasmantaṁ ānandaṁ bhagavā etadavoca: ",
  "sn2.29:1.3": "“tuyhampi no, ānanda, sāriputto ruccatī”ti? ",
  "sn2.29:2.1": "“Kassa hi nāma, bhante, abālassa aduṭṭhassa amūḷhassa avipallatthacittassa āyasmā sāriputto na rucceyya? ",
  "sn2.29:2.2": "Paṇḍito, bhante, āyasmā sāriputto. ",
  "sn2.29:2.3": "Mahāpañño, bhante, āyasmā sāriputto. ",
  "sn2.29:2.4": "Puthupañño, bhante, āyasmā sāriputto. ",
  "sn2.29:2.5": "Hāsapañño, bhante, āyasmā sāriputto. ",
  "sn2.29:2.6": "Javanapañño, bhante, āyasmā sāriputto. ",
  "sn2.29:2.7": "Tikkhapañño, bhante, āyasmā sāriputto. ",
  "sn2.29:2.8": "Nibbedhikapañño, bhante, āyasmā sāriputto. ",
  "sn2.29:2.9": "Appiccho, bhante, āyasmā sāriputto. ",
  "sn2.29:2.10": "Santuṭṭho, bhante, āyasmā sāriputto. ",
  "sn2.29:2.11": "Pavivitto, bhante, āyasmā sāriputto. ",
  "sn2.29:2.12": "Asaṁsaṭṭho, bhante, āyasmā sāriputto. ",
  "sn2.29:2.13": "Āraddhavīriyo, bhante, āyasmā sāriputto. ",
  "sn2.29:2.14": "Vattā, bhante, āyasmā sāriputto. ",
  "sn2.29:2.15": "Vacanakkhamo, bhante, āyasmā sāriputto. ",
  "sn2.29:2.16": "Codako, bhante, āyasmā sāriputto. ",
  